// Temporal forbid (re-grounding after a denial).
// Once an execute_sql_query call has been denied in this session (it touched a
// PII or cost column, tripped a guardrail, hit the rate limit, ...), every
// further query is denied until the agent re-reads the schema with
// get_tables_information. Uses the Dogwood `!L since within W R` idiom:
// "a denied query (R) happened in the last 5 minutes, and no successful schema
// lookup (L) has happened since". A denied call is recorded as ::error.
forbid(
  principal,
  action == AgentCore::Action::"DatabaseToolsTarget___execute_sql_query",
  resource == AgentCore::Gateway::"{{GATEWAY_ARN}}"
)
when temporal {
  !AgentCore::Action::"DatabaseToolsTarget___get_tables_information"::response{
    eventResource: resource
  }
  since within 5m
    AgentCore::Action::"DatabaseToolsTarget___execute_sql_query"::error{
      eventResource: resource
    }
};
